{"key":"ai","num":"163","title":"Anguilla","blurb":"Every place GeoNames records above 500 people in Anguilla: 14 towns and villages, grouped by region and ordered by population.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anguilla","d":"Anguilla is a British Overseas Territory of the Caribbean region in the North Atlantic Ocean. It is one of the most northerly of the Leeward Islands in the Lesser Antilles, lying east of Puerto Rico and the Virgin Islands and directly north of Saint Martin. The territory consists of the main island of Anguilla, approximately 16 miles (26 kilometres) long by 3 miles (5 km) wide at its widest point, together with a number of much smaller islands and cays with no permanent population. The territory's capital is The Valley. The total land area of the territory is 35 square miles (91 km2), with a population of approximately 15,753 in 2021.","i":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Anguilla-aerial_view_western_portion.jpg/500px-Anguilla-aerial_view_western_portion.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","ic":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Anguilla-aerial_view_western_portion.jpg","groups":[{"name":"The Valley","items":[{"n":"The Valley","u":"https://www.geonames.org/3573374","p":2035,"t":"capital"}]},{"name":"Blowing Point","items":[{"n":"Blowing Point Village","u":"https://www.geonames.org/3573496","p":942,"t":"village"}]},{"name":"East End","items":[{"n":"East End Village","u":"https://www.geonames.org/3573473","p":671,"t":"village"}]},{"name":"Sandy Hill","items":[{"n":"Sandy Hill","u":"https://www.geonames.org/11205445","p":636,"t":"village"}]},{"name":"Sandy Ground","items":[{"n":"Sandy Ground Village","u":"https://www.geonames.org/3573407","p":274,"t":"village"}]},{"name":"West End","items":[{"n":"West End Village","u":"https://www.geonames.org/3573364","p":0,"t":"village"}]},{"name":"The Quarter","items":[{"n":"The Quarter","u":"https://www.geonames.org/3573375","p":0,"t"